# Only the Tier 3 (critical) paths from docs/risk-tiers.md and risk-config.json
# are listed, and there is no catch-all `*`. The master ruleset
# (docs/branch-protection.md) does not require code owner review, so these
# lines only request the owner's review; if a ruleset ever requires it, every
# path listed here needs the owner's approving review before it can merge, and
# a `*` line would extend that to every pull request. Tier 1 and Tier 2 paths merge on
# the required checks. scripts/check-policies.mjs fails when an owner-review path
# is missing here, when a later line takes one off the owner, or when a `*` line
# comes back. docs/agent-boundaries.md explains it.

